date-released: 2026-08-23
keywords:
  - dengue
  - epidemiology
  - risk prediction
  - logistic regression
  - public health
  - SINAN
abstract: >-
  Interpretable dengue risk models trained on 9.45 million notification records
  from Brazil's national surveillance system (SINAN, 2023-2025), externally
  validated against the Lancet Global Health IDAMS model, and deployed as a
  multilingual public self-assessment web service.
